---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {services} from '../data/site';
import {getProjects} from '../lib/projects';
const projects=await getProjects();
---
<Base title="Systems, debugging & integration"><div class="editorial-page content-width"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT SERVICES</p><h1>Build game features.<br/>Fix bugs.<br/>Connect existing systems.</h1><p class="lead">I develop Roblox game features and investigate bugs in existing projects. Explore the examples below to see the kind of work I do.</p><div class="service-list">{services.map((s,i)=><section class="service-detail"><span class="mono">0{i+1}</span><div><h2>{s.title}</h2><p>{s.description}</p></div><a class="text-link" href={`/projects/${s.project}/`}>See {projects.find(p=>p.id===s.project)!.data.shortTitle} ↗</a></section>)}</div><section class="editorial-grid"><h2>When your existing<br/>game needs help</h2><div><p>Some bugs appear only when several features interact. I can help reproduce the problem, find which parts of the game are conflicting, and work out a focused fix.</p><p>I can review existing code, investigate performance problems, and plan changes to how features fit together. The examples on this site come from my own games.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Describe the problem ↗</a></div></section></div></Base>
